Subject: [PATCH 13/69] arm64: dts: renesas: draak: enable I2C controller 1
Date: Fri, 16 Mar 2018 15:50:43 +0100
Message-Id: <41337aa1556a38a0b6861447ba7861c3a34bc204.1521206129.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
In-Reply-To: <cover.1521206129.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
